  description: '[Active]: Secretly bet on a target. You win if you are the ONLY gambler
    (as 1st voter) OR if BOTH players gambled (as 2nd voter).

    Reward: Target
    gets +1 vote.

    Penalty: The card you voted for the most loses 1 vote.'
